                        "entry_id": "21eb5302-3007-3a95-bd92-c002bcea8e11",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The bone of the ankle, forming the lower part of the ankle joint and joining with the tibia and fibula."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "06cc40e9-5352-408e-bbea-8167870b61c8",
                                "sense_id": "7d735b3a-0114-3a8f-92cd-0884aa1d93ce",
                                "text": "And immediatly his fete ãd anclebones receaved ſtrenght / and he ſprange / ſtode / ãd alſo walked / ãd entred with them into the temple walkinge / and leapynge / and laudynge god."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
